%% Normal, manual profile edit (observed with DevTools)
sequenceDiagram
    actor User as User (own account)
    participant Browser
    participant Elgg

    User->>Browser: Click "Edit profile", change fields
    Browser->>Elgg: GET /profile/<user>/edit (form + __elgg_ts/__elgg_token)
    Elgg-->>Browser: Edit form HTML
    User->>Browser: Save
    Browser->>Elgg: POST /action/profile/edit<br/>name, briefdescription, description,<br/>accesslevel[], guid, __elgg_ts, __elgg_token<br/>(+ session cookie, auto)
    Elgg->>Elgg: Validate CSRF token, persist metadata
    Elgg-->>Browser: 302 redirect to profile
    Browser->>Elgg: GET profile
    Elgg-->>Browser: Profile with new values rendered
